    "section_text_8MUdPj": {
      "type": "section-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_hLX8Dc": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><em>WANDERINGS™ </em>Collection: <strong>PALMS</strong></p>",
            "size": 60,
            "margin_bottom": 50,
            "heading_highlight_type": "highlight-color",
            "highlight_color": "#000000",
            "highlight_text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "text_TAJynC": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>As a California Coastal brand, we are never short of palm trees to photograph.<br/>And honestly, we can’t seem to get enough of their towering fronds. Whether it’s the sound of the wind blowing overhead…or simply basking in their shade…something about palm trees and their ‘easy-breezy' attitude stands miles above the rest.</p>",
            "size": 100,
            "max_width": 650,
            "margin_bottom": 25
          }
        },
        "text_XrhBnt": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The WANDERINGS™ PALMS COLLECTION is inspired by endless time spent wandering coastal shores and tropical Islands, far & wide.</p>",
            "size": 100,
            "max_width": 675,
            "margin_bottom": 25
          }
        },
        "text_gxC6p8": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>In this PALMS Collection, you will find palms in all kinds & colors—from deep earthy greens, to pastel sunset hues—to dark moody palms, and simple blacks & whites.<br/>We hope these images relax you and whisk you away. <br/>We hope they inspire you…to WANDER</p>",
            "size": 100,
            "max_width": 675,
            "margin_bottom": 25
          }
        },
        "separator_8jCiMT": {
          "type": "separator",
          "settings": {
            "separator_width": 30,
            "margin_top": 50,
            "margin_bottom": 50
          }
        },
        "text_KHGkie": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The WANDERINGS™ PALMS Collection<br/>is presented in 9 Series/Parts.</p>",
            "size": 100,
            "max_width": 700,
            "margin_bottom": 25
          }
        },
        "text_LtQKFx": {
          "type": "text",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Not all available artwork is featured on this website. If you would like to see the full WANDERINGS™ PEONIES Collection, please email us at <a href=\"mailto:hello@shopwander.com\" title=\"mailto:hello@shopwander.com\">hello@shopwander.com</a> to get access to our WANDERINGS™ Catalogs, which contain the entire Collections, in full.</p>",
            "size": 100,
            "max_width": 1000,
            "margin_bottom": 25
          }
        }
      },
